{"ts":1779339998357,"state_hash":"76a2e454363ee20a","passage":"Canvas_scene_kitchen_diana_morning_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: Diana — kitchen (morning) (scene_kitchen_diana_morning) | Node: Kitchen — Diana (morning)\n\n\n\n[IMAGE MISSING] scenes/kitchen_with_diana.jpg\n\nDiana at the kitchen stove, her back to the door, a coffee mug on the counter beside her.\n\n🔍 middle aged woman kitchen morning coffee stove southern rural🔍 mother in kitchen breakfast preparation morning light farmhouse🔍 forties woman kitchen sink window morning light coffee🔍 southern mother kitchen stove pancakes morning light family🔍 rural alabama farmhouse kitchen mother morning routine\n\n\n\nDiana's at the stove, her back to you. She doesn't turn around.\n\nDiana: Eggs in the pan. Help yourself.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSit with her a minute.\nCoffee and out.\n","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> Diana — kitchen (morning) <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(scene_kitchen_diana_morning)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Kitchen — Diana (morning)</div><br><div style=\"border:2px dashed #666;padding:20px;margin:10px 0;border-radius:8px;background:#f5f5f5;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:bold;color:#333;\">[IMAGE MISSING] scenes/kitchen_with_diana.jpg</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0 0;color:#666;font-style:italic;\">Diana at the kitchen stove, her back to the door, a coffee mug on the counter beside her.</p><div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=middle+aged+woman+kitchen+morning+coffee+stove+southern+rural&amp;_tmc_game=output&amp;_tmc_scene=scenes%2Fkitchen_with_diana.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:4px 8px 4px 0;padding:6px 12px;background:#3b82f6;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;\" class=\"link-external\" tabindex=\"0\">🔍 middle aged woman kitchen morning coffee stove southern rural</a><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=mother+in+kitchen+breakfast+preparat